      "content": "That's interesting. Can you expand on that? When you say Julian has the \"inherent gravitas\" and Arjun's approach might \"clash,\" are you saying there's something about their fundamental profiles that makes them more or less suited for these specific boardroom environments? I want to make sure I'm not missing any subtle cues in their backgrounds that would affect how a traditional CEO perceives them.",
